00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:26.120
Bob: Yeah, it's almost like that's an accurate thing to accuse you of.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.360
Jack: Wade, I think you're pretty solid, Wade.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:30.760
Wade: Yeah, but I can't actually move, so...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.100
Jack: I mean, they're in the same house, but, you're pretty solid.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:36.100
Wade: I'm sure I'm fine. They'll never- They wouldn't dare look here.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.540
Jack: They'll probably leave.
Wade: Oh hey, they looked here.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.020
Jack: Ohhh...

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:45.320
Jack [harsh whisper]: I think us talking out loud may have ruined that!
Wade: They can't hear us.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.760
Wade: With the power of imagination-
Jack: Someone's outside like a fuckin-

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:51.800
Jack: Someone's outside like a macaroon though.
Wade: Yeah, I hear them stomping in the snow.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:57.740
Mark: I'm watching.
Jack: Apparently it's probably that- It's probably that 'Plier!
Wade: Yeah.
Bob: I don't understand.

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:04.120
Bob: I think Wade's a tiny thing underneath a thing, but I'm not sure.
Jack: He's not. He's not.
Wade: No, I'm not.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.760
Mark: So he's a-
Jack: He's actually pretty easy to find if you're not stupid.
Mark: Yeah.
Wade: Yeah.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.360
Bob: Well then, I must not have looked in the right room yet, 'cause I know I'm stupid.
Wade: Yeah, that's quite accurate.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:15.400
Mark: Hmmm... Hmmm...
Jack: Yeah, probably.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:18.460
*muffled boom*
Wade: I'm sure I'm- GAH HA!
Mark: *laughs*
Jack: *laughs*

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:22.220
Bob: You're right! Once I walked into the right room, it was IMMEDIATELY clear!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:23.340
Jack: I told you.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:28.220
Wade: Oh hey, there's Mark in the window.
Mark: Hiiii, I'm here too, guys.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:32.080
Bob: *laughs*
Wade: Jack, we had great scores! I feel good about it.
Jack: Ooo!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:38.880
*"Crazy La Paint" by MiniMusicMan plays*

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.900
*music descends*

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.940
